---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<!-- Challenge: Adoption -->
<div class="green-gradient rounded-lg p-6 mb-6">
  <h3 class="text-lg font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
    <Icon name="carbon:user-favorite" class="w-6 h-6 text-green-600" />
    Challenge: Developer Adoption (0% → 60% in 6 Months)
  </h3>

  <div class="bg-white/80 rounded-lg border border-green-200 dark:bg-black/40 dark:border-green-600/30 p-5 mb-4">
    <h4 class="font-bold text-sm mb-6 text-gray-900 dark:text-white text-center border-b border-green-200 dark:border-green-600/30 pb-4">The Adoption Journey: 6 Months from PoC to GA</h4>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-3">
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 mx-auto dark:bg-primary-600">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-primary-600 dark:text-white">1-2</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Proof of Concept</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">5 engineers, 85% "extremely useful"</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 mx-auto dark:bg-blue-600">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-blue-600 dark:text-white">3-4</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Private Beta</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">45 users, 3 teams, 62% weekly active</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-cyan-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 mx-auto dark:bg-cyan-600">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-cyan-600 dark:text-white">5</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">Open Beta</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">380 signups in 2 weeks</div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 mx-auto dark:bg-green-600">
          <span class="text-sm font-bold text-green-600 dark:text-white">6</span>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-1 dark:text-white">General Availability</div>
        <div class="text-xs text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">6,000+ users, 60% adoption</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 mb-4 gap-2">
    <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200 dark:bg-black/40 dark:border-green-600/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <Icon name="carbon:star" class="w-5 h-5 text-primary-600" />
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 mb-0 dark:text-white">Champions Program</h4>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 mb-2 dark:text-gray-300">I personally recruited 12 champions, respected engineers, not just volunteers. Gave them early access. Office hours, team demos, feedback collection.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-800 italic font-semibold dark:text-white">Why it worked: Developers trust peer recommendations > management mandates</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200 dark:bg-black/40 dark:border-green-600/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <Icon name="carbon:timer" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 mb-0 dark:text-white">Frictionless Onboarding</h4>
      </div>
      <code class="text-xs bg-black/5 px-2 py-1 rounded block mb-2 dark:bg-black/80">npx @company/frontend-platform setup</code>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-800 mb-2 dark:text-gray-300"><strong>One command, 60 seconds, zero config.</strong> Auto-installs VS Code extension, GitHub Actions, linting.</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-800 italic font-semibold dark:text-white">30% of eligible engineers adopted in first week</p>
    </div>
    <div class="bg-white/80 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200 dark:bg-black/40 dark:border-green-600/30">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-2">
        <Icon name="line-md:navigation-right-up" class="text-green-500" />
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-gray-900 mb-0 dark:text-white">Progressive Enforcement</h4>
      </div>
      <ul class="text-xs text-gray-800 mb-2 dark:text-gray-300 list-disc not-prose pl-5 space-y-2">
        <li>Month 1-2: Warnings only</li>
        <li>Month 3: Soft gates (can bypass)</li>
        <li>Month 4: Hard gates (critical only)</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-800 italic font-semibold dark:text-white">Gradual tightening based on adoption data</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-2 mb-4">
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-green">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-green-600 mb-1">60%</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">Weekly Active Use</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">720 of 6,000 engineers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-blue">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-600 mb-1">100%</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">Team Coverage</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">All 24 product teams</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-purple">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-primary-600 mb-1">+76</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">NPS Score</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">vs +30 industry avg</p>
    </div>
    <div class="metric-box metric-box-orange">
      <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-orange-600 mb-1">2-3x</div>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-700 font-semibold dark:text-white">Industry Benchmark</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300">Exceeded expectations</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card-white p-4 mb-4">
    <h4 class="font-semibold mb-2">Results I'm Proud Of</h4>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-800 dark:text-gray-300">
      <strong>60% weekly active adoption</strong> is 2-3x industry benchmark for internal developer tooling (typically 20-30%). We achieved this by focusing on developer experience, not edicts. I measured success by: <strong>60% WAU</strong>, <strong>100% team coverage</strong>, <strong>NPS +68</strong>, and most importantly: <strong>67% fewer UI bugs</strong> in teams using the tooling.
    </p>
  </div>


  <div class="text-center">
    <a href="/adoption" class="text-sm text-green-700 hover:text-green-800 font-semibold inline-flex items-center gap-1">
      Learn more about the full adoption strategy
      <Icon name="carbon:arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
